sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    %% =========================================================================
    %% RAG QUESTION-ANSWERING SEQUENCE
    %% Verified runtime path: AiChatPanel -> Hybrid Search -> Ollama -> Page Citation
    %% =========================================================================

    actor User as Researcher
    participant UI_Chat as AI Panel (&lt;AiChatPanel&gt;)
    participant UI_Viewer as PDF Viewer (&lt;PdfViewer&gt;)
    participant API as Backend API (Django DRF /chat/)
    participant RAG as RAG Service (rag_service.py / DocumentRAG)
    participant LLM as Local LLM Server (Ollama llama3.2:3b)

    %% Step 1: User Query Submission
    User->>UI_Chat: Type question &amp; submit (e.g. "Explain the core methodology")
    activate UI_Chat
    UI_Chat->>API: POST /api/v1/documents/{id}/chat/ { "question": "..." }
    activate API
    API->>RAG: query_document(doc_id={id}, file_path, question, doc_title)
    activate RAG

    %% Step 2: In-Memory Hybrid Retrieval (Dense Cosine + BM25Okapi RRF)
    RAG->>RAG: Generate query embedding via intfloat/e5-small-v2 (prefix 'query: ')
    RAG->>RAG: Compute dense cosine similarity (embeddings @ query_emb)
    RAG->>RAG: Compute lexical BM25Okapi scores on tokenized query
    RAG->>RAG: Apply Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF, k=60) &amp; select Top-5 chunks
    RAG->>RAG: Extract chunk metadata: page_number, section_title, snippet

    %% Step 3: Grounded Context Assembly & LLM Generation
    RAG->>RAG: Assemble grounded prompt with context snippets and academic persona
    RAG->>LLM: POST http://localhost:11434/api/generate { model: "llama3.2:3b", prompt, stream: false }
    activate LLM

    alt Ollama Server Online
        LLM-->>RAG: HTTP 200 { "response": "Synthesized academic answer..." }
        RAG->>RAG: Package response with model="llama3.2:3b (Local RAG)"
    else Ollama Offline or Timeout (60s)
        LLM--xRAG: Connection refused or timeout
        RAG->>RAG: Grounded Synthesis Fallback (compile top-3 snippet excerpts directly)
        RAG->>RAG: Package response with model="Grounded Hybrid RAG (Local)"
    end
    deactivate LLM

    %% Step 4: Return Answer & Citations
    RAG-->>API: Return { answer, sources: [{ page: 2, chunk_id: "...", snippet: "..." }], model }
    deactivate RAG
    API-->>UI_Chat: HTTP 200 OK (JSON with answer &amp; sources)
    deactivate API

    %% Step 5: Citation Rendering & Canvas Navigation
    UI_Chat-->>User: Render markdown answer with clickable [Page 2] citation badge
    deactivate UI_Chat

    User->>UI_Chat: Click [Page 2] citation badge
    activate UI_Chat
    UI_Chat->>UI_Viewer: onJumpToPage(2)
    activate UI_Viewer
    UI_Viewer->>UI_Viewer: scrollToPage(2) on PDF.js canvas
    UI_Viewer-->>User: Smoothly display and focus Page 2 in document reading pane
    deactivate UI_Viewer
    deactivate UI_Chat
